# R7.5: the app put away and brought back, as on a phone. Run twice on the same data folder:
# the first run puts the app away during a game (it pauses and keeps the game in
# states/resume.state) and quits as if the system had closed it; the second run starts
# with that game, paused, from the same place ("lifecycle: game resumed, ..., as kept").
# A second part of the first run: back in the foreground the kept game is dropped.
wait 6000
expect menu
tap a
wait 9000
expect game
wait 2000
background
wait 500
expect pause
foreground
wait 500
expect pause
tap b
wait 500
expect game
wait 2000
background
wait 500
expect pause
quit
